WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.135 --> 00:00:01.957
- I just want to notify
everyone in advance that

00:00:01.957 --> 00:00:04.397
I will be calling it a vagina
bag, because in the UK,

00:00:04.397 --> 00:00:05.999
fanny means vagina.

00:00:05.999 --> 00:00:08.083
(upbeat music)

00:00:11.056 --> 00:00:13.942
- My name's Alicia, and
I'm a fanny pack guru.

00:00:14.217 --> 00:00:16.014
So if you're trying fanny
packs out for the first time,

00:00:16.014 --> 00:00:18.117
the best advice I can
give you is to just exude

00:00:18.117 --> 00:00:19.833
confidence with it.

00:00:19.833 --> 00:00:21.554
There's no inappropriate
moment for a fanny

00:00:21.554 --> 00:00:23.818
if you have the right look going on.

00:00:23.818 --> 00:00:25.832
Fanny packs for life.

00:00:25.832 --> 00:00:28.009
(upbeat music)

00:00:28.930 --> 00:00:30.776
- I would prefer if
fanny packs were a thing

00:00:30.776 --> 00:00:32.297
that were like socially acceptable.

00:00:32.297 --> 00:00:33.761
- I actually wore a
fanny pack to Disneyland

00:00:33.761 --> 00:00:34.957
the last time I went,

00:00:34.957 --> 00:00:36.615
and that was actually the
most amazing experience ever,

00:00:36.615 --> 00:00:38.437
because it was just so freeing!

00:00:38.437 --> 00:00:41.630
- My shoulders always hurt
from carrying a purse around.

00:00:41.630 --> 00:00:43.589
- One of my friends is coming
into town this weekend,

00:00:43.589 --> 00:00:45.028
so I'm going to go to a fancy dinner

00:00:45.028 --> 00:00:46.936
in a fanny pack for sure.

00:00:46.936 --> 00:00:48.119
- I'm afraid that it's not going to match

00:00:48.119 --> 00:00:49.153
with all my clothes.

00:00:49.153 --> 00:00:50.635
- I'm really worried about what people are

00:00:50.635 --> 00:00:51.894
going to say or think,

00:00:51.894 --> 00:00:53.377
because it means you're
looking at my crotch.

00:00:53.377 --> 00:00:55.477
(upbeat music)

00:00:56.017 --> 00:00:57.274
- I like these sunglasses.

00:00:57.274 --> 00:00:59.027
I'm going to make mine look like an emoji.

00:00:59.027 --> 00:01:01.043
Like an emoji exploded all over.

00:01:01.043 --> 00:01:02.564
- This is actually quite well themed.

00:01:02.564 --> 00:01:03.946
Mine's a bit erratic.

00:01:03.946 --> 00:01:05.806
- Yes!

00:01:05.806 --> 00:01:08.628
- Simple, and I like the back.

00:01:08.628 --> 00:01:10.787
- It's a bit coordinated by accident.

00:01:10.787 --> 00:01:14.091
It looks like NASA/someone
that likes drugs.

00:01:14.091 --> 00:01:17.212
- I got America all over my fanny.

00:01:17.212 --> 00:01:19.378
(upbeat music)

00:01:20.392 --> 00:01:23.272
- So my first experience
was temperamental,

00:01:23.272 --> 00:01:24.829
because every time I walked,

00:01:24.829 --> 00:01:27.590
it bounced and made its
way around to the front,

00:01:27.590 --> 00:01:29.968
even when I didn't require it to.

00:01:29.968 --> 00:01:31.214
- Ok so I'm moving today,

00:01:31.214 --> 00:01:32.986
and my friend Amber is
going to come help me.

00:01:32.986 --> 00:01:34.901
I am wearing my fanny pack.

00:01:34.901 --> 00:01:36.585
And she just knocked, so let's go.

00:01:36.585 --> 00:01:37.668
- A fanny pack?

00:01:37.668 --> 00:01:38.907
(laughing)

00:01:38.907 --> 00:01:40.127
I like it.

00:01:40.127 --> 00:01:41.291
- Would you wear one?

00:01:41.291 --> 00:01:42.530
- Yeah, I have one!

00:01:42.530 --> 00:01:45.804
- It is not the most fashionable,
and I already look nuts,

00:01:45.804 --> 00:01:47.450
so I feel like it just makes it worse.

00:01:47.450 --> 00:01:50.973
- It's making me realize
how much I care about

00:01:50.973 --> 00:01:53.396
other people's validation
with what I'm wearing.

00:01:53.396 --> 00:01:55.254
- We're at Griffith Park
right now, we're on a hike.

00:01:55.254 --> 00:01:57.157
This is the reason why fanny packs exist,

00:01:57.157 --> 00:02:00.361
because I have never felt so comfortable.

00:02:00.361 --> 00:02:02.277
- Today I'm going to try and buy a car

00:02:02.277 --> 00:02:04.656
with my fanny pack on.

00:02:04.656 --> 00:02:06.557
I don't think they're
going to take me seriously.

00:02:06.557 --> 00:02:10.577
- I've been validating the
experience to other people

00:02:10.577 --> 00:02:13.399
by saying it's an experiment.

00:02:13.399 --> 00:02:15.590
- I haven't gotten any
questions about it today.

00:02:15.590 --> 00:02:18.318
But it's more annoying than I expected.

00:02:18.318 --> 00:02:20.091
The novelty has worn off.

00:02:20.091 --> 00:02:21.943
(techno music)

00:02:22.363 --> 00:02:24.151
- I loved wearing a fanny pack.

00:02:24.151 --> 00:02:26.344
It was super convenient,
it was really easy,

00:02:26.344 --> 00:02:28.271
the only part was it
looked terrible with almost

00:02:28.271 --> 00:02:29.710
every outfit.

00:02:29.710 --> 00:02:31.131
- This thing is too small.

00:02:31.131 --> 00:02:33.209
It's like I can barely fit anything in it.

00:02:33.209 --> 00:02:35.644
- I was starting to fashion my outfits

00:02:35.644 --> 00:02:37.304
around the fanny pack.

00:02:37.304 --> 00:02:39.367
You just have to wear like sporty clothes.

00:02:39.367 --> 00:02:43.143
- You either look like
a small child or a mom.

00:02:43.143 --> 00:02:45.327
So today I've gone with the
forty-year-old mother look.

00:02:45.327 --> 00:02:47.310
And I'm neither of those things.

00:02:47.310 --> 00:02:48.869
But I felt I had to dress that way.

00:02:48.869 --> 00:02:51.491
- I wasn't putting my purse
on the ground all the time.

00:02:51.491 --> 00:02:54.904
Not sure how I feel peeing with this on.

00:02:54.904 --> 00:02:57.444
I guess it's better than
putting a purse on the ground.

00:02:57.444 --> 00:02:59.141
- If you care what people think about you,

00:02:59.141 --> 00:03:01.368
I wouldn't wear a fanny pack.

00:03:01.368 --> 00:03:04.059
(upbeat music)

